{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51461","headline":"泛石岐海 · 郑愚","name":"泛石岐海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此日携琴剑，飘然事远游。\n台山初罢雾，岐海正分流。\n渔浦扬来笛，鸿逵翼去舟。\n鬂愁蒲柳早，衣怯芰荷秋。\n未卜虞翻宅，休登王粲楼，怆然怀伴侣，徒尔赋离忧。\n（《嘉庆广东通志》一○一《山川略·香山县》）（〖1〗《全唐诗》卷五九七收「台山」以下四句，题爲《幼作》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}